  <!--
    A hundred and fifty-four settings, drawn by twenty-odd elements. The list
    on the right is filled from the catalogue: the category list narrows it,
    the field under it filters by name or description, and the one draft
    field on the right edits whichever row is selected. A switch and a
    choice are changed by clicking the value itself; a colour and a list
    open the sub-page they need, because neither fits one line of text.
  -->
  <!--
    The UB page, laid out as the tool it comes from lays out its own front
    page: three columns of push buttons, each saying whether one tool is
    running and flipping it when pressed. Every button is a view of the
    catalogue row the UB settings tab shows; nothing here keeps a second
    copy of a switch.
  -->
  <group x="8" y="42" w="976" h="229" visible="{UbVisible}" anchor="left top right bottom">
